<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex"><title>Kilpinen Lab · Content editor</title><style is:global>body{margin:0;background:#e4eaf0;color:#203849;font:17px/1.7 Arial,sans-serif}main{max-width:760px;margin:8vh auto;padding:2rem}h1{font-size:2.8rem;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.1}a{color:#096b74}li{margin:.5rem 0}code{background:#d0dce5;padding:.2rem .4rem;font-size:.9rem}.status{border:1px solid #aebfcd;padding:1.5rem;border-radius:.5rem}button{padding:1rem;background:#096b74;color:white;border:0;border-radius:2rem;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #203849;outline-offset:4px}</style></head><body><main id="setup"><a href="/">← Back to the website</a><p>WEBSITE EDITOR</p><h1>Your lab's content,<br>in one place.</h1><p>Add topics, projects, people, publications, photographs and new pages through content forms.</p><div class="status"><strong id="status">Hosted editing is not connected yet.</strong><p id="instructions">A maintainer needs to connect the lab's GitHub repository, configure GitHub sign-in, and connect publishing. This private website preview does not save content through this page.</p></div><h2>Edit on your computer</h2><ol><li>Open the website folder and run <code>npm ci</code>.</li><li>Run <code>npm run dev</code> in one terminal.</li><li>Run <code>npx --yes decap-server@3.3.1</code> in another terminal, in the same folder.</li><li>Open <code>http://localhost:4321/admin/</code>.</li></ol><p>Local saves change your website files. Publishing those changes is a separate step.</p><p><a href="https://decapcms.org/docs/decap-proxy/">Local editing guide ↗</a> · <a href="https://decapcms.org/docs/github-backend/">Connect GitHub editing ↗</a></p><button id="open" hidden>Open content editor</button><p id="error" role="status"></p></main><script is:inline>
(async()=>{const local=['localhost','127.0.0.1'].includes(location.hostname);let enabled=false;try{enabled=(await(await fetch('/admin/editor-settings.json')).json()).enabled===true}catch{}if(local||enabled){document.querySelector('#status').textContent=local?'Local editing mode':'Content editor connected';document.querySelector('#instructions').textContent=local?'Start the local proxy with npx --yes decap-server@3.3.1, then open the editor. Saves update files on this computer.':'Sign in with an authorized GitHub account to edit content.';const b=document.querySelector('#open');b.hidden=false;b.onclick=()=>{b.disabled=true;b.textContent='Loading editor…';const s=document.createElement('script');s.src='https://unpkg.com/decap-cms@3.8.4/dist/decap-cms.js';s.onload=()=>document.querySelector('#setup').remove();s.onerror=()=>{document.querySelector('#error').textContent='Could not load the editor. Check your internet connection and try again.';b.disabled=false;b.textContent='Open content editor'};document.body.append(s)}}})();
</script></body></html>